---
// Founder Watchdog waitlist: a demand test, not a product page (Nov 13 2026; docs/founder-watchdog-mvp.md).
// Nothing is for sale here: no Stripe link, no beta, no promise to build. The planned $9/$90 is shown so interest is
// measured against a real number. Mode comes from PUBLIC_WATCHDOG_WAITLIST (src/config.ts):
//   off     -> this route is only a redirect to /founders/ (production default until Michael says otherwise)
//   preview -> full page, noindex, the form shows what it would send and sends nothing
//   live    -> the form POSTs to the quiz Worker's /watchdog route (same host the CSP already allows)
// Entry points pass ?from=<touchpoint>&domain=<domain> (WatchdogCta.astro). Umami events carry track=founders.
import { WATCHDOG_WAITLIST } from '../../config';
import Redirect from '../../components/Redirect.astro';
import WatchdogWaitlist from '../../components/WatchdogWaitlist.astro';
---
{WATCHDOG_WAITLIST === 'off' ? <Redirect to="/founders/" /> : <WatchdogWaitlist />}
